    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama, boat assembly: correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks structurally sound, but there are a few things we can tweak. For example\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_axehitscrape"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": -20,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": 20,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There, that should make it more solid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama, Zumama: amazing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just the product of experience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There you are, Zumama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Inam? What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This survey equipment has to get across, right? I came to help since I didn't have anything else to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you thanking me? Looks like you're actually becoming one of these robots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm glad to make so many new friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama, Zumama: friend!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've been trying to find a date for Lancet-2.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lancet-2 is the robot that came with Rhodes Island, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, she's my big sister now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not skilled enough to make a robot as smart as Lancet-2, so I'm trying to find one in this group.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're very nice, but not really her type.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She likes intellectuals, like the Doctor. It's a bit of a headache.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind, you're not the only weirdo in Tiacauh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_femalecommentator",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey everybody, this is Croque, and I've found a safer vantage point to continue the broadcast from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "How far until goal? 300m? Ah, forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's really important is that the architect Stitch Canvas, the only student of Master Finch, has found a boat and jumped into the race!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Looks like he's talking to us. Let's zoom in and see what he's saying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I'm gonna win,' I think. Yup, I'm sure that's it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "And he just raised his middle finger to show his motivation. Looks like there's a fiery heart beneath this architect's cold surface!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "He may have gotten a late start, but that vehicle is definitely a huge advantage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's closing the distance as we speak!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Things are pretty lively over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to say that this is what happens with Gavial around, but she's not the only one who's let her hair down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not used to it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You have to get used to it, living in Acahualla.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "You get so used to it I feel weird if there's no one arguing and making noise around me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a proper Tiacauh now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speaking of which, Zumama, if Gavial didn't come back the year before last, you were planning to become the Great Chief of Acahualla, weren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Becoming Great Chief wasn't the real goal; it was a way for me to prove myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to build the most powerful machine ever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew I shouldn't have placed any expectations on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you thinking about being lord ameer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good to see that you and Tomimi have learned something about politics, unlike Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know how she's survived on the outside all these years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Some things we deal with as a matter of course just don't factor in for Gavial. Like adapting to your environment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, that's true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So you want her to become lord ameer? Are you sure she's suitable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Pretty sure you could pick somebody off any street in Sargon and get a better lord ameer than her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Agreed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But if we're choosing a Tiacauh to lead Acahualla, there's no one more suitable than her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you speaking as a Tiacauh, or as a Sargon Messenger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_femalecommentator",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're entering the final stretch of the race!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial remains in first place, but her lead continues to shrink.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not Avdotya who's closing the distance, though!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Despite her valiant effort, her choice of clothing has become dead weight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Literally, as the weight of her clothes is slowing her down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meanwhile, Elysium is rapidly closing in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Conserving his strength in the first half, Elysium now shows off his true ability.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "He has passed Avdotya and is almost neck-and-neck with Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "However\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Neither of them are aware of the true threat approaching!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm impressed with Elysium. I never thought he could catch up to Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "His attitude is a mask. You can't get complacent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I noticed. He doesn't want people to know how good he is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't change the subject.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, looks like you've learned a thing or two at Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not on purpose, but Master Closure makes me go to meetings about stuff besides technology, so I've heard a bunch of things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like she has high hopes for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for your question...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've lived in Acahualla for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to city life, I prefer to stay in the jungles, watching you people fight over stupid things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it's hard to believe, but for me, I'm a Tiacauh a Sargon Messenger at the same time. I don't have to pick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or I guess I could say, my Sargon perspective tells me that Acahualla won't stay unexplored forever. That's why I hope you'll seize the opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_femalecommentator",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "We're headed towards a climax.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exercising his explosive potential, Elysium has almost caught up to Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya's not out of this race yet, though, and she's still keeping pace with the two in front of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to push it, Avdotya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now all three of them have noticed the threat approaching from behind\u2014Stitch, riding in his boat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wonders of machinery! He has caught up to the three in front of him in a very short period of time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only a hundred meters to the goal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's like we're at the starting line again. Three swimmers and a boat, racing their way into the final stretch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Inam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't help you convince her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial should not sit in that chair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll get the same answer if you ask Tomimi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Figure it out for yourself. I'm busy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have too much free time, you can help me build this boat while you think about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You really count every last coin, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "Eighty meters!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya got caught in the boat's wake. She's coughing and she has to stop! Yes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, I mean, what a shame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fifty meters!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elysium tries to board the boat, but took an accidental hit from Master Edge, who is angry at Stitch, and falls back into the water!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are bubbles coming to the surface. Is he okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thirty meters!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Master Edge leaps from Gavial's back onto the Ale Keg, and hits Stitch on the head!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch! That must have hurt!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, Ale Keg is the name that I just gave to this boat, following in the footsteps of my other masterpiece, 'The Great Aquapit'!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like the winner will be Ga\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, not quite!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fight between Master Edge and Stitch has destroyed the boat's instruments!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's an ominous rumble coming from the Ale Keg!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "She dashes ahead like an arrow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not even Gavial can catch the out-of-control boat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The boat is the first to arrive at the goal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The winner of this swimming contest is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Announcement From Afar"
    },
